  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Sabores",
    "@en": "Taste"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Pedas** es picante, **manis**, dulce, **asin**, salado, y **asam**, ácido. **Enak** significa rico o sabroso.",
     "@en": "**Pedas** is spicy, **manis**, sweet, **asin**, salty, and **asam**, acid. **Enak** means rich or tasty."
    }
